    <!-- http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation1 -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation1">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#RationaleExplanation"/>
        <explanationPattern:isBasedOn rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskAssessment1"/>
        <phmo:isConsumedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Atieno"/>
        <phmo:hasText>Your AF risk assessment of 10 July 2026 found that your risk of developing AF is raised. The main reasons are your hypertension (high blood pressure) and your alcohol use.</phmo:hasText>
        <core2:hasTimestamp rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2026-07-10T14:30:00+03:00</core2:hasTimestamp>
        <rdfs:comment>Example statistical and rationale explanation of Atieno&apos;s AF risk assessment, provided to Atieno.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>AF risk explanation 1</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation2 -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation2">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#DataExplanation"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#SafetyAndPerformanceExplanation"/>
        <explanationPattern:isBasedOn rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskAssessment1"/>
        <phmo:isConsumedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#DrChebet"/>
        <phmo:hasText>The assessment was made by a hybrid Bayesian network trained and tested on the MIMIC-IV dataset. It achieved an AUROC of 0.82, a recall of 0.89, and a specificity of 0.58 at its decision threshold of 0.053.</phmo:hasText>
        <core2:hasTimestamp rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2026-07-10T14:30:00+03:00</core2:hasTimestamp>
        <rdfs:comment>Example data explanation of Atieno&apos;s AF risk assessment, provided to her clinician Dr Chebet.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>AF risk explanation 2</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation3 -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation3">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#CounterfactualExplanation"/>
        <explanationPattern:isBasedOn rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskAssessment1"/>
        <phmo:isConsumedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Bahati"/>
        <phmo:hasText>Atieno&apos;s risk of developing atrial fibrillation (AF) is raised, mainly because of her hypertension (high blood pressure). If hypertension was absent, the assessed AF risk would fall from 45 in 100 to 20 in 100.”</phmo:hasText>
        <core2:hasTimestamp rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2026-07-10T14:30:00+03:00</core2:hasTimestamp>
        <rdfs:comment>Example counterfactual explanation of Atieno&apos;s AF risk assessment, provided to her caregiver Bahati.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>AF risk explanation 3</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation4 -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskExplanation4">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#ContrastiveExplanation"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://purl.org/heals/eo#scientificExplanation"/>
        <explanationPattern:isBasedOn rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#AFRiskAssessment1"/>
        <phmo:isConsumedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#DrChebet"/>
        <phmo:hasText>The hybrid Bayesian network classified Atieno&apos;s AF risk as present on 10 July 2026, with a calibrated probability of 0.64 against a decision threshold of 0.053. Hypertension is the input state that distinguishes this result from AF risk absent; it is an established risk factor for AF in the 2024 ESC guidelines for the management of AF.</phmo:hasText>
        <core2:hasTimestamp rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTimeStamp">2026-07-10T14:30:00+03:00</core2:hasTimestamp>
        <rdfs:comment>Example scientific and contrastive explanation of Atieno&apos;s AF risk assessment, provided to her clinician Dr Chebet.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>AF risk explanation 4</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


