    <!-- http://purl.org/afmo#SecaScaleUpLine -->


    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://purl.org/afmo#SecaScaleUpLine">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://saref.etsi.org/saref4ehaw/HealthDevice"/>
        <core2:consistsOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Seca257"/>
        <core2:consistsOf rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#Seca654"/>
        <core2:hasManufacturer>Seca GmbH &amp; Co. KG</core2:hasManufacturer>
        <rdfs:comment>The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>seca Scale-up Line measuring station</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.org/afmo#SecaScaleUpLine"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The seca Scale-up Line is probably the most modern and pioneering option for determining size and weight. Firstly on account of the contactless, fast, and high-precision ultrasonic measurement. Secondly because of the ID-Display, which shows the names or IDs of patients and users during data transfer to the digital patient record (EMR). This measuring station from the seca Scale-up Line is therefore the ideal choice for EMR-integrated weighing and measuring.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>https://www.seca.com/en_ae/products/all-products/product-details/seca654.html, accessed 06 July 2026.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


